<mxCell id="10" value="A — AUTH &amp; ONBOARDING" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#7c3aed;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="760" height="32" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="11" value="LOGIN SCREEN
─────────────────────────
[BTN: Continue with Google] → OAuth 2.0 popup
[BTN: Connect Crypto Wallet] → WalletConnect QR
[INPUT: Email] validate on blur
[INPUT: Password] eye-toggle visibility
[BTN: Log In] → POST /auth/login → JWT stored
  Wrong password → error toast
  5 fails → 30-min lockout
[LINK: Forgot password?] → OTP reset flow
[LINK: Sign Up] → node signup
[LINK: Sign in as Business] → node bizAuth
Swipe up → dismiss keyboard" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1e1e2e;strokeColor=#7c3aed;fontColor=#e2e8f0;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="90" width="360" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="12" value="SIGN UP FLOW  (5-step progress bar)
─────────────────────────
Step 1: Email + Password  (strength meter)
  [BTN: Next] → sends OTP to email
Step 2: Verify OTP  (6-digit, auto-advance)
  [LINK: Resend] 60s cooldown
Step 3: @username  (live availability check)
Step 4: Select Interests ≥3 tags  (drives feed)
  [LINK: Skip]
Step 5: Profile Photo
  [BTN: Take Photo] / [BTN: Gallery]
  [LINK: Skip] → default avatar
  [BTN: Save &amp; Finish] → Home" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1e1e2e;strokeColor=#7c3aed;fontColor=#e2e8f0;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="90" width="360" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
