<mxCell id="15" value="LAYOUT  (/  — Layout.tsx wraps all routes via Outlet)
MOBILE BOTTOM NAV (md:hidden, fixed, z-50):
  [🏠 Home] → /  |  [👥 Friends] → /friends  |  [+ Create] → /create (gradient button)
  [💬 Inbox] → /inbox  |  [👤 Profile] → /profile
DESKTOP SIDEBAR (hidden md:flex, w-60): sections Social / Platforms / Creator / Account
  Social: Home · Friends · Discover(/search) · Inbox · Community
  Platforms: KliqTube · KliqStream · Marketplace
  Creator: Kliq Studio · Amplify
  Account: Wallet · Profile · Settings
  Footer: Tier badge (Tier X — Basic/Plus/Pro) + Upgrade button (if tier &lt; 3) → /settings
HEADER (all sizes): KLIQ logo  |  [🔔 Bell] → /inbox (red dot)  |  [Avatar] → opens Action Panel
  Dev-only tier switcher [T1][T2][T3] (lg:flex, sets UserContext tier)
ACTION PANEL (right-side drawer, z-50, opened by avatar click):
  Header: avatar + Sarah Jenkins / @sarah_vlogs + [✕ close]
  Items: Wallet · Analytics · Offline Videos · Kliq Stream · KliqTube
         Kliq Business · Kliq Studio · Amplify · Settings &amp; Privacy
  Footer: [Switch Account] → /settings  |  [Sign Out] → /login
SCROLL: flex-1 overflow-y-auto overscroll-contain pb-16 md:pb-0 (Outlet container)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1e1e2e;strokeColor=#7c3aed;fontColor=#e2e8f0;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="360" width="760" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
