<mxCell id="49" value="MARKETPLACE  (/marketplace)
─────────────────────────
HEADER:
  [🔍 Search bar] → Elasticsearch geo+full-text
  [⊞ Filters] → sort/price/category sheet
  [🛍 Sell BTN] → Sell modal (ALL tiers T1–T3)
CATEGORY CHIPS (scroll): All/Digital/Physical/Services
TOP STORES row (scroll):
  Store card: avatar + name + category
  Tap → /store/:id
FEATURED COLLECTIONS row (scroll):
  Collection card: image + name + item count + floor price
ITEMS GRID (2-col):
  Card: image + category badge + ❤ count
       title + @creator + verified badge
       price (+ USD equiv if crypto)
       [Buy Now] → wallet payment flow
       [Offer] → offer form → seller notified
  Tap image → full product view
  Tap @creator → /store/:id

SELL MODAL (sheet, all tiers):
  STOREFRONT CARD:
    T3 Pro: [Open My Storefront] → /customize-shop
    T1/T2: locked card + T3 badge + [Upgrade →]
  QUICK LIST — Available to all sellers:
    [SELECT: Type] Digital/Physical/Service
    [INPUT: Title]
    [TEXTAREA: Description]
    [INPUT: Price] + [SELECT: Currency]
    [BTN: Upload Images]
    [BTN: Create Listing] → success screen
  SUCCESS SCREEN: green check + &quot;Listing Created!&quot;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1e1e2e;strokeColor=#7c3aed;fontColor=#e2e8f0;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1100" width="380" height="340" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
