<mxCell id="57" value="WALLET  (/wallet)
─────────────────────────
BALANCE CARD (gradient):
  Total Balance  → $X,XXX.XX  (font-black, live state)
  Tokens counter (live) · Diamonds counter
  [+ Top Up BTN] → opens TopUp modal
  [↑ Withdraw BTN] → opens Withdraw modal
QUICK ACTIONS (3-col):
  [Buy Tokens → TopUp modal]
  [Add Card → TopUp modal]
  [Transfer → Transfer modal]
RECENT ACTIVITY list:
  Row: icon (income green/expense red) + title + date + amount (bold)
  Tap row → transaction detail
  [View All BTN]" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1e1e2e;strokeColor=#7c3aed;fontColor=#e2e8f0;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1660" width="380" height="320" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="58" value="TOP UP MODAL  (slide-up sheet)
─────────────────────────
METHOD SELECTOR:
  [💳 Fiat (Card/Bank)] ← default
  [🪙 Crypto (ETH/BTC)]
FIAT PATH:
  Quick amounts: [$5][$10][$25][$50]
    → selected state: purple highlight (live state)
  [INPUT: Custom amount]  free text
  Token conversion table:
    $5 = 550 tokens · $10 = 1,150 (+50 bonus)
    $25 = 3,000 (+250) · $50 = 6,000 (+1,000)
  [BTN: Proceed to Payment]
    → parseAmount → setBalance += amount
    → setTokens += tokens+bonus
    → dismiss modal → success toast
    → balance display updates live (bold)
CRYPTO PATH:
  ETH wallet address (copy-able)
  Rate: 1 ETH ≈ $3,200
