<mxCell id="98" value="API GATEWAY
─────────────────────────
Single entry for all client requests
Rate limiting: 100 req/s per user (burst 500)
JWT validation: rejects expired tokens
Request routing: paths → microservices
Load balancing: round-robin across replicas
CDN edge caching: static assets + thumbnails
CORS headers: whitelisted origins only
SSL termination: TLS 1.3
Audit logging: all requests logged" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0c1a1a;strokeColor=#14b8a6;fontColor=#5eead4;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2310" width="340" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="99" value="AUTH SERVICE
─────────────────────────
Login / logout / refresh tokens
OTP generation + verification (10min TTL Redis)
Google OAuth 2.0 flow
Apple Sign In
WalletConnect / MetaMask nonce signing
Password hashing: bcrypt
JWT signing (RS256)
Lockout: 5 fails → 30-min cooldown" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0c1a1a;strokeColor=#14b8a6;fontColor=#5eead4;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="2310" width="300" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="100" value="USER SERVICE
─────────────────────────
Profile CRUD: GET/PATCH /users/:id
Follow / unfollow: fan-out on write
Block / mute management
Search users (Elasticsearch)
Referral tracking
Tier management
KYC status" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0c1a1a;strokeColor=#14b8a6;fontColor=#5eead4;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="2310" width="300" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="101" value="FEED SERVICE
─────────────────────────
For You: ML ranking → Recommendation Engine
Following: fan-out on write → Redis feed cache
Friends: filtered following (mutuals only)
Community: per-community event log (Cassandra)
Pagination: cursor-based
Feed expiry: &gt;7 days dropped from cache
A/B test traffic splitting at feed layer" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0c1a1a;strokeColor=#14b8a6;fontColor=#5eead4;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1040" y="2310" width="320" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="102" value="MEDIA SERVICE
─────────────────────────
Chunked video upload (5MB chunks, resumable)
HLS transcoding: AWS Elemental MediaConvert
  Outputs: 360p/480p/720p/1080p/4K (Tier 3)
Image processing: resize+compress+WebP
Thumbnail generation: 6 frames per video
S3 raw storage + transcoded HLS segments
CDN distribution: CloudFront edge nodes
DRM wrapping: Widevine + FairPlay" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0c1a1a;strokeColor=#14b8a6;fontColor=#5eead4;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1380" y="2310" width="320" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="103" value="PAYMENT SERVICE
─────────────────────────
Stripe: cards global (170+ countries)
  Stripe Connect: seller payouts
  Stripe Radar: fraud scoring
Flutterwave: Africa (cards+bank+USSD)
MTN MoMo / Airtel / M-Pesa: mobile money
Coinbase Commerce: crypto checkout
Escrow engine: holds funds until delivery
In-app token ledger (not fiat-convertible)
Subscription billing (Tier 2/3 recurring)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0c1a1a;strokeColor=#14b8a6;fontColor=#5eead4;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1720" y="2310" width="340" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="104" value="NOTIFICATION SERVICE
─────────────────────────
FCM (Android + web PWA push)
APNs (iOS: certificate p8 key)
  VoIP pushes for incoming calls
OneSignal: unified API + segmentation
  Delivery analytics (open rate, A/B test copy)
In-app: stored PostgreSQL, fetched on open
  Read/unread state per notification
Email: SendGrid (account changes, payouts)
SMS: Twilio (2FA, fraud alerts — critical only)
Batching: groups '5 new likes' etc." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0c1a1a;strokeColor=#14b8a6;fontColor=#5eead4;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2080" y="2310" width="340" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="105" value="CONTENT MODERATION  (AI Pipeline)
─────────────────────────
Step 1 — Intake &amp; Length Analysis:
  Detect duration, resolution, bitrate, format
  HLS transcode → 6 thumbnail candidates
  Audio waveform extraction (fingerprint)
  Routing: &lt;60s reel / 60s-10m video / &gt;10m long
  &gt;4GB auto-reject · unsupported codec auto-reject
Step 2 — AI Scan:
  Copyright: audio fingerprint (Audible Magic)
  Nudity/violence: AWS Rekognition
  Hate speech: NLP classifier
Step 3 — Human Review Queue (if AI uncertain):
  Approve · Reject · Age-restrict · Escalate
  Appeals process (48h, different moderator)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0c1a1a;strokeColor=#14b8a6;fontColor=#5eead4;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2500" width="340" height="180" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="106" value="RECOMMENDATION ENGINE  (ML)
─────────────────────────
For You feed ranking model
Signals: watch time %, skip, like, share, follow,
  replay, sound, hashtag, location, search history
Content-based: similar to liked content
Collaborative: users with similar taste
Real-time reranking every 3 posts
A/B testing: 2 ranking algorithms tested
Cold-start: new users → interest-seeded feed
Diversity: max 3 posts per creator per 20
Retrained weekly on fresh engagement data" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0c1a1a;strokeColor=#14b8a6;fontColor=#5eead4;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="2500" width="320" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="107" value="SEARCH SERVICE  (Elasticsearch)
─────────────────────────
Full-text index: users, posts, sounds, hashtags
Real-time updates on post publish
Autocomplete: N-gram tokenisation
Trending topics: hourly hashtag aggregation
Personalised results: follow-graph proximity
Geo-search: marketplace location results
Spell correction: fuzzy matching
Multi-language: 70+ language tokenisers" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0c1a1a;strokeColor=#14b8a6;fontColor=#5eead4;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="740" y="2500" width="320" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="108" value="LIVE STREAMING SERVICE
─────────────────────────
Agora.io: WebRTC SDK (mobile hosts)
  Low-latency &lt;500ms interactive
  Co-host multi-party rooms
RTMP ingest: for OBS/external software (Tier 3)
  URL + stream key provided in host dashboard
Gift engine: token deduction → diamond credit
  Diamond conversion: 1 token = 0.5 diamonds
Chat: Redis pub/sub → WebSocket broadcast
Moderation: keyword filter, timeout, ban
Post-stream: VOD saved (if record toggle on)
  Stream summary: peak viewers, gifts, diamonds" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0c1a1a;strokeColor=#14b8a6;fontColor=#5eead4;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="2500" width="340" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="109" value="COMPLIANCE &amp; FRAUD  (backend)
─────────────────────────
Reserve floor: company ≥20% of user balances
  Below → withdrawals queued with user message
Fraud ML flags:
  3× typical amount · new device + large TX
  Rapid deposit-withdraw cycle · VPN
  → Auto-hold 24h for review
AML: &gt;$1,000/24h logged
  &gt;$5,000 single TX: manual AML review
  Structuring detection
SAR auto-filed: $10,000+ in 30d, sanctions match
User limits dashboard: progress bars + [Upgrade KYC]" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0c1a1a;strokeColor=#14b8a6;fontColor=#5eead4;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="2500" width="360" height="180" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="118" value="Q — DATABASES &amp; STORAGE" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#7c3aed;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2730" width="2400" height="32" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="119" value="PostgreSQL  (primary relational)
─────────────────────────
Users, profiles, tiers, follows, blocks
Posts, comments, likes, shares
Marketplace orders, products, storefronts
Transactions, wallet balances, payouts
Subscriptions, tier billing records
Notifications (read/unread state)
KYC documents, compliance logs" style="shape=mxgraph.flowchart.database;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#064e3b;strokeColor=#10b981;fontColor=#6ee7b7;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2780" width="300" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="120" value="Redis  (cache + sessions + realtime)
─────────────────────────
Session tokens: refresh → user_id mapping
Rate limiting counters: per IP + per user
Feed cache: pre-computed For You per user
Hot content: trending posts + viral videos
Live viewer counts: HyperLogLog per stream
Leaderboards: top gifters, referrers (sorted sets)
Pub/Sub: live chat message distribution
Distributed locks: prevent double-spend
OTP cache: 10min TTL
Autocomplete: top search suggestions" style="shape=mxgraph.flowchart.database;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#064e3b;strokeColor=#10b981;fontColor=#6ee7b7;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="360" y="2780" width="320" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="121" value="MongoDB / DynamoDB  (document store)
─────────────────────────
Analytics events (time-series)
Notification logs
A/B test results
Activity Centre records (watch history, etc.)
Community event logs
Content moderation decision logs" style="shape=mxgraph.flowchart.database;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#064e3b;strokeColor=#10b981;fontColor=#6ee7b7;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="2780" width="300" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="122" value="Elasticsearch  (search + trending)
─────────────────────────
Post / user / sound / hashtag search index
Autocomplete (N-gram)
Trending topics aggregation (hourly)
Geo-search (marketplace products)
Multi-language tokenisers (70+)
Real-time index on new publish" style="shape=mxgraph.flowchart.database;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#064e3b;strokeColor=#10b981;fontColor=#6ee7b7;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1020" y="2780" width="300" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="123" value="AWS S3  (blob storage)
─────────────────────────
Raw uploaded video files
Transcoded HLS segments (multi-quality)
Images: avatars, banners, product photos
Movie/series content (DRM-wrapped)
Subtitle files (.srt/.vtt)
User-exported data ZIPs (GDPR)
Signed URLs for DRM (expire 4h)" style="shape=mxgraph.flowchart.database;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#064e3b;strokeColor=#10b981;fontColor=#6ee7b7;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1340" y="2780" width="300" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="124" value="Cassandra  (wide-column, time-series)
─────────────────────────
Community feed event logs
Live stream chat history
Long-term analytics retention
High-write, time-ordered feeds
Horizontal scaling for scale" style="shape=mxgraph.flowchart.database;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#064e3b;strokeColor=#10b981;fontColor=#6ee7b7;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1660" y="2780" width="300" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="131" value="R — EXTERNAL APIS &amp; INTEGRATIONS" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#7c3aed;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2980" width="2400" height="32" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="132" value="AUTH APIs
─────────────────────────
Google OAuth 2.0
Apple Sign In
WalletConnect (Web3)
MetaMask / Phantom (Ethereum wallet)
Twilio Verify (SMS OTP)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1e3a5f;strokeColor=#3b82f6;fontColor=#93c5fd;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="3030" width="300" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="133" value="PAYMENT APIs
─────────────────────────
Stripe: cards, Connect payouts, Radar fraud
Flutterwave: Africa (card/bank/USSD/QR)
MTN MoMo API: request-to-pay + disbursements
Airtel Money / M-Pesa: same pattern
Binance API: crypto price feeds + spot trading
Coinbase Commerce: crypto checkout widget" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1e3a5f;strokeColor=#3b82f6;fontColor=#93c5fd;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="360" y="3030" width="320" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="134" value="PUSH NOTIFICATION APIs
─────────────────────────
Firebase FCM (Android + web PWA)
APNs (iOS, p8 certificate auth)
OneSignal: cross-platform wrapper
  Audience segmentation + A/B testing
  Delivered/opened analytics" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1e3a5f;strokeColor=#3b82f6;fontColor=#93c5fd;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="3030" width="300" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="135" value="MEDIA &amp; VIDEO APIs
─────────────────────────
AWS Elemental MediaConvert: HLS transcoding
  Outputs: 360p/480p/720p/1080p/4K
  Thumbnail sprites
Mux.com: video hosting + analytics (fallback)
FFmpeg (self-hosted): audio fingerprint,
  clip creation, format conversion
Agora.io: WebRTC live SDK (&lt;500ms latency)
  Co-host multi-party room" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1e3a5f;strokeColor=#3b82f6;fontColor=#93c5fd;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1020" y="3030" width="320" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="136" value="COMMUNICATION APIs
─────────────────────────
Twilio: SMS OTP + voice + critical alerts
SendGrid: transactional email
  Account changes, payouts, reports, KYC
Vonage: video calls (future)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1e3a5f;strokeColor=#3b82f6;fontColor=#93c5fd;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1360" y="3030" width="300" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="137" value="AI / CONTENT APIs
─────────────────────────
AWS Rekognition: nudity/violence detection
Audible Magic: copyright fingerprinting
Custom NLP classifier: hate speech
Kliq ML Platform: recommendation engine
  For You feed ranking, A/B testing" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1e3a5f;strokeColor=#3b82f6;fontColor=#93c5fd;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1680" y="3030" width="300" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="138" value="CDN &amp; INFRA
─────────────────────────
AWS CloudFront: HLS video (200+ PoPs)
  Adaptive bitrate per connection speed
  Signed URLs for DRM (expire 4h)
  Cache-Control headers per content type
Cloudflare: DDoS protection, Magic Transit
  Edge caching images/thumbnails (24h TTL)
  Geo-blocking for region-specific content" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1e3a5f;strokeColor=#3b82f6;fontColor=#93c5fd;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2000" y="3030" width="400" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
